  "schemaVersion": "0.3.0-alpha",
  "programId": "saturday-brunch-for-four",
  "name": "Saturday Brunch for Four",
  "environmentType": "kitchen",
  "actors": 1,
  "tracks": [
    {
      "trackId": "bacon",
      "name": "Bacon",
      "steps": [
        { "stepId": "lay-bacon", "name": "Lay bacon and bake", "task": "oven", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 1200 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "programStart" } },
        { "stepId": "drain-bacon", "name": "Drain bacon", "task": "prep", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 120 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "lay-bacon" } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "pancakes",
      "name": "Pancakes",
      "steps": [
        { "stepId": "prep-pancake-batter", "name": "Prepare pancake batter", "task": "prep", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 600 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "programStart" } },
        { "stepId": "rest-batter", "name": "Rest batter", "task": "none", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 600 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "prep-pancake-batter" } },
        { "stepId": "heat-griddle", "name": "Heat griddle", "task": "burner", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 300 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "rest-batter" } },
        { "stepId": "cook-pancakes", "name": "Cook pancakes", "task": "burner", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 900 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "heat-griddle" } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "fruit-salad",
      "name": "Fruit Salad",
      "steps": [
        { "stepId": "prep-fruit-salad", "name": "Prepare fruit salad", "task": "prep", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 600 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "programStart" } },
        { "stepId": "chill-fruit-salad", "name": "Chill fruit salad", "task": "prep", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 900 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "prep-fruit-salad" } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "coffee",
      "name": "Coffee",
      "steps": [
        { "stepId": "grind-coffee", "name": "Grind and setup coffee", "task": "prep", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 180 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "programStart" } },
        { "stepId": "brew-coffee", "name": "Brew coffee", "task": "prep", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 480 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "grind-coffee" } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "serve",
      "name": "Serve",
      "steps": [
        { "stepId": "serve-brunch", "name": "Serve brunch", "task": "prep", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 120 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "compound", "logic": "all", "triggers": [
          { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "drain-bacon" },
          { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "cook-pancakes" },
          { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "chill-fruit-salad" },
          { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "brew-coffee" }
        ] } }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "resourceConstraints": [
    { "task": "oven", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "burner", "maxConcurrent": 2 },
    { "task": "prep", "maxConcurrent": 1 }
  ]
}
```

### Step 4 & 5: Validation and Analysis

Let's validate and analyze the program.

```json
// After running validate_program and fixing any errors,
// then analyze_schedule with finishAt="10:00"
```

Assuming the program is valid, `analyze_schedule` will provide insights into the makespan, critical path, and any resource conflicts. Let's hypothetically say the analysis indicates the program can be completed within 45 minutes, with "prep" being a critical constraint due to the sequential nature of some tasks.

### Step 6: Visualizing the Schedule

Finally, we call `visualize_schedule` to get the live timeline.

The output of `visualize_schedule` will include the live URL and a Gantt/itinerary. Let's assume the start time is calculated to be 9:15 to finish by 10:00.

```json
{
  "liveUrl": "https://example.rhylthyme.com/timeline/abc123",
  "gantt": "ASCII Gantt chart here",
  "itinerary": "Wall-clock itinerary here"
}
```

